2814+ 6A37              ; search_by_Busy_dir_slow
2815+ 6A37              ; Fully bank-safe fallback. It is used only when a file name itself crosses a
2816+ 6A37              ; #FFFF -> #C000 directory-page boundary. Such names are rare, so paging cost
2817+ 6A37              ; no longer slows down every ordinary FIND operation.
2818+ 6A37              ;
2819+ 6A37              ; One-character FIND is handled before this fallback and compares only the
2820+ 6A37              ; first character.  This slow path therefore normally handles 2+ character
2821+ 6A37              ; substring searches whose source name crosses a directory-bank boundary.
2822+ 6A37              ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
